{'symbol': 'BXP', 'date': '2021-07-07 07:00:00', 'title': 'BOSTON PROPERTIES ANNOUNCES LEADERSHIP TRANSITION FOR NEW YORK REGION', 'text': "BOSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--BOSTON PROPERTIES, INC. (NYSE: BXP), THE LARGEST PUBLICLY TRADED DEVELOPER, OWNER, AND MANAGER OF CLASS A OFFICE PROPERTIES IN THE UNITED STATES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT HILARY SPANN WILL SUCCEED JOHN POWERS AS HEAD OF THE COMPANY'S NEW YORK OFFICE EFFECTIVE JANUARY 1, 2022. MR. POWERS HAS DECIDED TO RETIRE FROM THE COMPANY IN DECEMBER 2021 AFTER MORE THAN EIGHT YEARS OF SERVICE. HILARY WILL JOIN BXP AS AN EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT IN SEPTEMBER 2021. “WE ARE GRATEFUL TO JOH"}